---
// YouTube Resumable Chunked Upload Protocol Sequence Diagram Component
---

<figure class="ytr-diag" aria-labelledby="ytr-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="ytr-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 340"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="ytr-diag-title ytr-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="ytr-diag-title">YouTube Data API 可續傳上傳時序圖</title>
    <desc id="ytr-diag-desc">
      依 YouTube Data API 文件：客戶端以 uploadType=resumable 建立工作階段並取得
      Location 網址，以 PUT 上傳，中斷後送出空的 PUT
      查詢已收到的範圍，再從下一個位元組續傳。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="ytr-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="ytr-diag__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="ytr-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="ytr-diag__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="ytr-arrow-amber"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="ytr-diag__arrow-head--amber"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="310"
      rx="12"
      class="ytr-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Top Actors Header -->
    <g transform="translate(60, 30)">
      <rect
        width="220"
        height="42"
        rx="8"
        class="ytr-diag__actor-box ytr-diag__actor-box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="110"
        y="26"
        class="ytr-diag__actor-text ytr-diag__actor-text--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        客戶端（API 呼叫端）
      </text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(600, 30)">
      <rect
        width="220"
        height="42"
        rx="8"
        class="ytr-diag__actor-box ytr-diag__actor-box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="110"
        y="26"
        class="ytr-diag__actor-text ytr-diag__actor-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        YouTube Data API 上傳端點
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Lifelines -->
    <line x1="170" y1="72" x2="170" y2="305" class="ytr-diag__lifeline"></line>
    <line x1="710" y1="72" x2="710" y2="305" class="ytr-diag__lifeline"></line>

    <!-- Step 1: Init Session -->
    <g transform="translate(0, 95)">
      <line
        x1="170"
        y1="0"
        x2="702"
        y2="0"
        class="ytr-diag__seq-line ytr-diag__seq-line--blue"
        marker-end="url(#ytr-arrow-blue)"></line>
      <rect
        x="235"
        y="-14"
        width="410"
        height="26"
        rx="4"
        class="ytr-diag__msg-pill"></rect>
      <text
        x="440"
        y="3"
        class="ytr-diag__msg-text ytr-diag__msg-text--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        1. POST …/videos?uploadType=resumable ➔ 200 + Location
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Step 2: Upload Chunk #1 -->
    <g transform="translate(0, 145)">
      <line
        x1="170"
        y1="0"
        x2="702"
        y2="0"
        class="ytr-diag__seq-line ytr-diag__seq-line--green"
        marker-end="url(#ytr-arrow-green)"></line>
      <rect
        x="245"
        y="-14"
        width="390"
        height="26"
        rx="4"
        class="ytr-diag__msg-pill"></rect>
      <text
        x="440"
        y="3"
        class="ytr-diag__msg-text ytr-diag__msg-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        2. PUT 工作階段網址（影片位元組，總長 2000000）
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Network Disconnect Alert -->
    <g transform="translate(240, 185)">
      <rect width="400" height="28" rx="6" class="ytr-diag__alert-box"></rect>
      <text x="200" y="18" class="ytr-diag__alert-text" text-anchor="middle">
        ⚠️ 連線中斷，或收到 500 / 502 / 503 / 504
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Step 3: Query Upload Status -->
    <g transform="translate(0, 235)">
      <line
        x1="170"
        y1="0"
        x2="702"
        y2="0"
        class="ytr-diag__seq-line ytr-diag__seq-line--amber"
        marker-end="url(#ytr-arrow-amber)"></line>
      <rect
        x="195"
        y="-14"
        width="490"
        height="26"
        rx="4"
        class="ytr-diag__msg-pill"></rect>
      <text
        x="440"
        y="3"
        class="ytr-diag__msg-text ytr-diag__msg-text--amber"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        3. 空 PUT（Content-Range: bytes */2000000）➔ 308, Range: bytes=0-999999
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Step 4: Resume Chunk #2 -->
    <g transform="translate(0, 285)">
      <line
        x1="170"
        y1="0"
        x2="702"
        y2="0"
        class="ytr-diag__seq-line ytr-diag__seq-line--green"
        marker-end="url(#ytr-arrow-green)"></line>
      <rect
        x="235"
        y="-14"
        width="410"
        height="26"
        rx="4"
        class="ytr-diag__msg-pill"></rect>
      <text
        x="440"
        y="3"
        class="ytr-diag__msg-text ytr-diag__msg-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        4. PUT bytes 1000000-1999999/2000000 ➔ 201 Created
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="ytr-diag__mobile">
    <div class="ytr-mobile-card ytr-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="ytr-mobile-badge ytr-mobile-badge--blue"
        >STEP 1: 建立工作階段</span
      >
      <h4>1. 取得可續傳的工作階段網址</h4>
      <p>
        客戶端對影片上傳端點送 POST，網址帶 <code>uploadType=resumable</code
        >，用 <code>X-Upload-Content-Length</code> 與
        <code>X-Upload-Content-Type</code> 宣告檔案大小與類型。成功時回 200，<code
          >Location</code
        > 標頭就是這次上傳的工作階段網址。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ytr-mobile-card ytr-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="ytr-mobile-badge ytr-mobile-badge--green"
        >STEP 2: 上傳影片</span
      >
      <h4>2. PUT 影片位元組</h4>
      <p>
        對工作階段網址送
        PUT，請求內容是影片的二進位資料。文件說分塊上傳很少需要、也不建議；真的要分塊時，每塊須是
        256 KB 的倍數，中間的分塊回 308，最後一塊回 201。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ytr-mobile-card ytr-mobile-card--alert">
      <span class="ytr-mobile-badge ytr-mobile-badge--alert">NETWORK EVENT</span
      >
      <h4>⚠️ 中斷時先查進度</h4>
      <p>
        連線中斷，或收到 500、502、503、504 時，可以續傳（5xx
        要用指數退避重試）。工作階段過期會回 404，這時要重新開始。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ytr-mobile-card ytr-mobile-card--amber">
      <span class="ytr-mobile-badge ytr-mobile-badge--amber"
        >STEP 3: 查詢進度</span
      >
      <h4>3. 空的 PUT 查詢已收到的範圍</h4>
      <p>
        對工作階段網址送空的 PUT，標頭帶 <code>Content-Length: 0</code> 與 <code
          >Content-Range: bytes */2000000</code
        >。還沒傳完時回 <code>308 Resume Incomplete</code>，<code
          >Range: bytes=0-999999</code
        > 表示已收到的位元組。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ytr-mobile-card ytr-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="ytr-mobile-badge ytr-mobile-badge--green">STEP 4: 續傳</span>
      <h4>4. 從下一個位元組續傳</h4>
      <p>
        從 Range 結尾的下一個位元組（1000000）繼續 PUT，帶 <code
          >Content-Range: bytes 1000000-1999999/2000000</code
        >。上傳完成時回 <code>201 Created</code> 與影片資源。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="ytr-diag-caption" class="ytr-diag__caption">
    圖一：YouTube Data API 的可續傳上傳協定（Resumable Upload）時序
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ytr-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ytr-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .ytr-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .ytr-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SVG Theme Token Styles */
  .ytr-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .ytr-diag__actor-box {
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .ytr-diag__actor-box--blue {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .ytr-diag__actor-box--green {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .ytr-diag__actor-text {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ytr-diag__actor-text--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .ytr-diag__actor-text--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .ytr-diag__lifeline {
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }

  .ytr-diag__seq-line {
    stroke-width: 2px;
  }

  .ytr-diag__seq-line--blue {
    stroke: #58a6ff;
  }

  .ytr-diag__seq-line--green {
    stroke: #3fb950;
  }

  .ytr-diag__seq-line--amber {
    stroke: #d29922;
  }

  .ytr-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .ytr-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .ytr-diag__arrow-head--amber {
    fill: #d29922;
  }

  .ytr-diag__msg-pill {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }

  .ytr-diag__msg-text {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ytr-diag__msg-text--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .ytr-diag__msg-text--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .ytr-diag__msg-text--amber {
    fill: #e3b341;
  }

  .ytr-diag__alert-box {
    fill: rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.12);
    stroke: #da3633;
    stroke-width: 1.2px;
  }

  .ytr-diag__alert-text {
    fill: #f85149;
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Light Theme Adjustments */
  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__actor-box--blue {
    fill: #eff7ff;
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__actor-box--green {
    fill: #dafbe1;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__actor-text--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__actor-text--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__lifeline {
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__msg-pill {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__msg-text--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__msg-text--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__msg-text--amber {
    fill: #9a6700;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__alert-box {
    fill: #ffebe9;
    stroke: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .ytr-diag__alert-text {
    fill: #cf222e;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .ytr-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .ytr-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .ytr-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      background: var(--dg-surface);
    }

    .ytr-mobile-card--blue {
      border-color: #388bfd;
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.05);
    }

    .ytr-mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #238636;
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.05);
    }

    .ytr-mobile-card--amber {
      border-color: #d29922;
      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.05);
    }

    .ytr-mobile-card--alert {
      border-color: #da3633;
      background: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.08);
    }

    .ytr-mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.125rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .ytr-mobile-badge--blue {
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.2);
      color: #58a6ff;
    }

    .ytr-mobile-badge--green {
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
      color: #3fb950;
    }

    .ytr-mobile-badge--amber {
      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.2);
      color: #e3b341;
    }

    .ytr-mobile-badge--alert {
      background: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.2);
      color: #f85149;
    }

    .ytr-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .ytr-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
    }

    .ytr-mobile-card code {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 0.2rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface-2);
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }
  }
</style>
